震える君のその手を 握る事さえも…
and couldn't even hold your trembling hand...

155
00:11:57,857 --> 00:12:00,756
キラリ光る 白い雪が
Sparkling and shining, the white snow

156
00:12:00,756 --> 00:12:05,117
少しずつ街を染めていくさ
slowly dyes the town little by little.

157
00:12:05,117 --> 00:12:08,356
二人で奏でるメロディ
The melody we play together,

158
00:12:08,356 --> 00:12:14,347
探しに出かけよう
let's go out and search for it.

159
