165
00:12:43,137 --> 00:12:48,047
去年冬より少し 大人びた君のその笑顔
Your smiling face, slightly more mature than last winter.

166
00:12:48,047 --> 00:12:54,307
不器用すぎた僕は 大事なこと見落とし
Being too clumsy, I overlooked the most important thing,

167
