169
00:13:05,156 --> 00:13:09,867
少しずつ頬を染めていく
slowly dyes our cheeks little by little.

170
00:13:09,867 --> 00:13:16,867
もう、二人で奏でるリズム 途切れないように、
So that the rhythm we play together will never be cut short,

171
00:13:17,027 --> 00:13:20,156
キラリ光る 白い雪が
Sparkling and shining, the white snow

172
